  ('1310 Series Hyper Hub (5mm Hex Bore)', '1310-0016-2005', 'The 5mm Hex Bore Hyper Hub is a heavy-duty option when fastening a goBILDA component, such as a gear, pulley or wheel to a REV Robotics 5mm Hex Shaft. Features Made for 5mm Hex Shafting This hub allows you to mount components to a 5mm hex shaft. Part of a Large Ecosystem of Parts The goBILDA® ecosystem has many parts that bolt directly to this hub. That includes wheels, gears, sprockets, track sprockets, timing pulleys, round belt pulleys, winch pulleys, control arms, and more! High-Speed…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1310-series-hyper-hub-5mm-hex-bore/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1454/images/11893/1310-0016-2005__03850.1715802043.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Pattern Adaptors', 'gobilda'),
  ('1310 Series Hyper Hub (3/8" Hex Bore)', '1310-0016-2375', 'This 3/8" hex bore Hyper Hub is a beefy solution for fastening a component to a 3/8" hex profile shaft—such as AndyMark Robits Hex Shafts as well as VEX 3/8" Hex and ThunderHex Shafts. Two pinch bolts constrict the hub onto the shaft for a no-slip connection between the shaft and the hub. A built-in shim provides for contact with a bearing without binding against the bearing''s outer race. And like all Hyper Hubs, this hub is balanced for use in high-speed applications! Features Made for 3/8"…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1310-series-hyper-hub-3-8-hex-bore/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2029/images/11888/1310-0016-2375-Main__69279.1715801508.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Pattern Adaptors', 'gobilda'),
  ('1310 Series Hyper Hub (1/2" Hex Bore)', '1310-0016-2500', 'Features Made for 1/2" Hex Shafting This hub allows you to mount components to a 1/2" hex shaft. Part of a Large Ecosystem of Parts The goBILDA® ecosystem has many parts that bolt directly to this hub. That includes wheels, gears, sprockets, track sprockets, timing pulleys, round belt pulleys, winch pulleys, control arms, and more! High-Speed Design - Completely Balanced The innovative Hyper Hub design is perfectly balanced. It will not introduce vibrations into your build, even in high-speed…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1310-series-hyper-hub-1-2-hex-bore/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1524/images/11879/1310-0016-2500__91767.1715801437.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Pattern Adaptors', 'gobilda'),
  ('1310 Series Hyper Hub (8mm REX® Bore)', '1310-0016-4008', 'This 8mm REX® bore Hyper Hub is a beefy solution for fastening a component to an 8mm REX® shaft. It achieves positive drive on 8mm REX® shafting with its 8mm REX® bore. Two pinch bolts constrict the hub onto the shaft for a no-slip connection between the shaft and the hub. A built-in shim provides for contact with a bearing without binding against the bearing''s outer race. Due to the greater length of Hyper Hubs relative to other hub styles, they''re the preferred design for handling…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1310-series-hyper-hub-8mm-rex-bore/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1228/images/11878/1310-0016-4008-Main__21284.1715800139.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Hubs / Shop by Hub Bore / 8mm REX® Bore Hubs', 'gobilda'),
  ('1310 Series Hyper Hub (12mm REX® Bore)', '1310-0016-4012', 'The 12mm REX® Bore Hyper Hub is a heavy duty, balanced, clamping solution to fastening onto a 12mm REX® Shaft. The dual pinch-bolts put a mega-hold on the shaft and the extended length of the hub offers excellent surface contact with the shaft. The REX® profile matches a 12mm REX® shaft so that a positive drive is created and there''s essentially no chance of slipping. As with all Hyper Couplers, this coupler is balanced so that it can be used in high-speed applications without introducing…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1310-series-hyper-hub-12mm-rex-bore/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1095/images/11870/1310-0016-4012__92141.1715799961.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Hubs / Shop by Hub Bore / 12mm REX® Bore Hubs', 'gobilda'),
  ('1310 Series Hyper Hub (4 Start, 8mm Lead Screw Bore)', '1310-0016-5008', 'This Hyper Hub has a threaded bore which matches the threads of an 8mm lead screw. It can clamp tightly around a lead screw to allow you drive the lead screw with a gear, sprocket or pulley attached to the hub in a linear motion assembly. Though hubs with an 8mm round bore may be able to attach to an 8mm lead screw, a lead screw bore (like this hub''s) provides the additional holding power that is sometimes needed to take the immense forces a lead screw can put on a hub. The built-in shim…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1310-series-hyper-hub-4-start-8mm-lead-screw-bore/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1302/images/11863/Ang1__03915__87798.1744657815.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Hubs / Shop by Hub Bore / 8mm Lead Screw Bore Hubs', 'gobilda'),
  ('1311 Series Thru-Hole Sonic Hub (6mm D-Bore)', '1311-0016-1006', 'Like all Sonic Hubs, this 6mm D-bore hub is well-balanced, and does not create vibrations in high-speed applications. Its thru-holes provide for compatibility with parts with threaded holes on the goBILDA® 16mm pattern. one(1) awesome use-case of this thru-hole hub is to fasten it to another hub to create a coupler between two differently-sized shafts! Features Made for 6mm D-Shaft This hub allows you to mount components to a 6mm D-shaft. Part of a Large Ecosystem of Parts The goBILDA® ecosystem…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1311-series-thru-hole-sonic-hub-6mm-d-bore/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1089/images/5404/1311-0016-1006-REV2__05084__03590.1701992522.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Pattern Adaptors', 'gobilda'),
  ('1311 Series Thru-Hole Sonic Hub (8mm REX® Bore)', '1311-0016-4008', 'This 8mm REX® Bore Sonic Hub has thru-holes on the 16mm goBILDA® hub pattern. Thru-hole hubs allow you to fasten to parts that have threaded holes. Having thru-hole hubs on-hand will changes your possibilities--fasten one(2) to another hub to create a coupler, sandwich a part between a threaded hub and a thru-hole hub for an extreme hold, or attach one(3) to the end of a length of goRAIL or goTUBE to drive the extrusion in a collection mechanism! Features Made for 8mm REX® Shafting This hub allows…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1311-series-thru-hole-sonic-hub-8mm-rex-bore/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1308/images/6453/1311-0016-4008-REV1__20448__20768.1701992854.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Hubs / Shop by Hub Bore / 8mm REX® Bore Hubs', 'gobilda'),
  ('1312 Series Double Sonic Hub (6mm D-Bore)', '1312-0016-1006', 'The 6mm D-Bore Double Sonic Hub is compatible with our 6mm D-shafting as well as the 5202 Series Gear Motors. The 16mm width of the hub provides additional clamping force and surface area when compared to the 1309 Series Sonic Hubs. Furthermore, it provides additional thread depth to hold components on each side of the hub if needed. Features Made for 6mm D-Shafting This hub allows you to mount components to a 6mm D-shaft. Part of a Large Ecosystem of Parts The goBILDA® ecosystem has many…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1312-series-double-sonic-hub-6mm-d-bore/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1087/images/5377/1312-0016-1006__03250__92159.1701992513.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Pattern Adaptors', 'gobilda'),
  ('1313 Series Hyper Hub (8mm REX® Bore)', '1313-1632-4008', 'The 8mm REX® bore Hyper Hub is a heavy-duty, balanced, clamping solution to fastening onto an 8mm REX® Shaft. The dual pinch-bolts put a mega-hold on the shaft and the extended length of the hub offers excellent surface contact with the shaft. The REX® profile matches a 8mm REX shaft so that a positive drive is created and there''s essentially no chance of slipping. As with all Hyper Hubs, this hub is balanced so that it can be used in high-speed applications without introducing vibrations. In…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1313-series-hyper-hub-8mm-rex-bore/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1655/images/16742/1313-1632-4008_REV1_Ang1__02584.1782145180.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Hubs / Shop by Hub Bore / 8mm REX® Bore Hubs', 'gobilda'),
  ('1313 Series Hyper Hub (12mm REX® Bore)', '1313-1632-4012', 'The 12mm REX® bore Hyper Hub is a heavy-duty, balanced, clamping solution for fastening onto a 12mm REX® Shaft. The dual pinch-bolts put a mega-hold on the shaft, and the extended length of the hub offers excellent surface contact with the shaft. The REX® profile matches a 12mm REX® shaft for fierce positive drive in which there''s essentially no chance of slipping. As with all Hyper Hubs, this hub is balanced so that it can be used in high-speed applications without introducing vibrations. In…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1313-series-hyper-hub-12mm-rex-bore/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2066/images/11850/1313-1632-4012__45424.1715798715.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Hubs / Shop by Hub Bore / 12mm REX® Bore Hubs', 'gobilda'),
  ('1314 Series Steel Set-Screw Hub (3mm Bore)', '1314-0016-0003', 'This 3mm bore set-screw hub allows you to rotate a gear, sprocket, pulley, bracket or beam via a 3mm diameter shaft. Its steel construction combines compact design with excellent structural integrity. Whereas most goBILDA® hubs have a 14mm diameter protrusion on their tops, this set-screw hub is flat, allowing you to utilize the rare instance of two middle holes located 16mm across from one(4) another—an excellent opportunity for building with beams! SET-SCREW WITH THREAD-LOCKING NYLON PATCH The…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1314-series-steel-set-screw-hub-3mm-bore/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2384/images/14717/Ang1__82982__51086.1744924809.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Hubs / Shop by Hub Style / Set-Screw Hubs (16mm Pattern)', 'gobilda'),
  ('1314 Series Steel Set-Screw Hub (4mm Bore)', '1314-0016-0004', 'This 4mm bore set-screw hub allows you to rotate a gear, sprocket, pulley, bracket or beam via a 4mm diameter round shaft. Its steel construction combines compact design with excellent structural integrity. Whereas most goBILDA® hubs have a 14mm diameter protrusion on their tops, this set-screw hub is flat, allowing you to utilize the rare instance of two middle holes located 16mm across from one(5) another—an excellent opportunity for building with beams!', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1314-series-steel-set-screw-hub-4mm-bore/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2026/images/11097/1314-0016-0004_Front_Angle__14257__72654.1701994315.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Hubs / Shop by Hub Bore / 4mm Round Bore Hubs', 'gobilda'),
  ('1314 Series Steel Set-Screw Hub (5mm Bore)', '1314-0016-0005', 'This 5mm bore set-screw hub allows you to rotate a gear, sprocket, pulley, bracket or beam via a 5mm diameter shaft. Its steel construction combines compact design with excellent structural integrity. Whereas most goBILDA® hubs have a 14mm diameter protrusion on their tops, this set-screw hub is flat, allowing you to utilize the rare instance of two middle holes located 16mm across from one(6) another—an excellent opportunity for building with beams!', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1314-series-steel-set-screw-hub-5mm-bore/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1898/images/10188/1314-0016-0005-FrontAngle__88331__89736.1701994025.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Hubs / Shop by Hub Bore / 5mm Round Bore Hubs', 'gobilda'),
  ('1314 Series Steel Set-Screw Hub (6mm Bore)', '1314-0016-0006', 'This 6mm bore set-screw hub allows you to rotate a gear, sprocket, pulley, bracket or beam via a 6mm diameter round shaft or 6mm diameter D-shaft. Its steel construction combines compact design with excellent structural integrity. Whereas most goBILDA® hubs have a 14mm diameter protrusion on their tops, this set-screw hub is flat, allowing you to utilize the rare instance of two middle holes located 16mm across from one(7) another—an excellent opportunity for building with beams! SET-SCREW WITH…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1314-series-steel-set-screw-hub-6mm-bore/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2021/images/11073/1314-0016-0006-Front-Angled__35856__41553.1701994307.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Pattern Adaptors', 'gobilda'),
  ('1314 Series Steel Set-Screw Hub (1/8" Bore)', '1314-0016-0125', 'This 1/8" bore set-screw hub allows you to rotate a gear, sprocket, pulley, bracket or beam via a 1/8" diameter shaft. Its steel construction combines compact design with excellent structural integrity. Whereas most goBILDA® hubs have a 14mm diameter protrusion on their tops, this set-screw hub is flat, allowing you to utilize the rare instance of two middle holes located 16mm across from one(8) another—an excellent opportunity for building with beams! SET-SCREW WITH THREAD-LOCKING NYLON PATCH…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1314-series-steel-set-screw-hub-1-8-bore/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2338/images/14300/Ang_1__24415__11506.1734630378.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Hubs / Shop by Hub Style / Set-Screw Hubs (16mm Pattern)', 'gobilda'),
  ('1314 Series Steel Set-Screw Hub (1/4" Bore)', '1314-0016-0250', 'This ¼" bore set-screw hub allows you to rotate a gear, sprocket, pulley, bracket or beam via a ¼" diameter shaft. Its steel construction combines compact design with excellent structural integrity. Whereas most goBILDA® hubs have a 14mm diameter protrusion on their tops, this set-screw hub is flat, allowing you to utilize the rare instance of two middle holes located 16mm across from one(9) another—an excellent opportunity for building with beams! SET-SCREW WITH THREAD-LOCKING…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1314-series-steel-set-screw-hub-1-4-bore/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1892/images/10158/1314-0016-0250-FrontAngle__97471__14219.1701994015.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Hubs / Shop by Hub Bore / 1/4" Round Bore Hubs', 'gobilda'),
  ('1315 Series Polycarbonate Hyper Hub (8mm REX® Bore) - 2 Pack', '1315-0016-4008', 'The 8mm REX® Bore Polycarbonate Hyper Hub is a budget-friendly solution for driving rotating components on positive-drive 8mm REX® shafting. This 2 Pack includes two hubs to double the reach of your wallet and your imagination! Polycarbonate Power The Polycarbonate Hub is lighter-weight and lower-cost compared to the aluminum 1310 Series Hyper Hub. Its polycarbonate plastic material rocks the right mixture of strength and pliability for achieving secure and reliable clamping to 8mm™ REX™…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1315-series-polycarbonate-hyper-hub-8mm-rex-bore-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2093/images/11840/1315-0016-4008__04702.1715798409.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Hubs / Shop by Hub Style / Hyper Hubs (16mm Pattern)', 'gobilda'),
  ('Matrix 12V 3000mAh NiMH Battery', '14-0014', 'This Modern Robotics 12V, 3000mAh battery (14-0014) is legal for use in FTC competition. The Sub-C cell size means the pack is just a few hairs shy of matching the width of 1120 Series or 1121 Series Channel. When the battery mount is installed on the outside of the channel, it''s easy to secure the battery to your robot chassis. The Tamiya connector allows this battery to be used with the Modern Robotics Power Distribution Module. The included Tamiya to XT30 Adaptor allows it to be used with…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/matrix-12v-3000mah-nimh-battery/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/799/images/4494/14-0014__00699__65544.1701992213.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('1400 Series 1-Side, 2-Post Clamping Mount (6mm Bore)', '1400-0032-0006', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1400-series-1-side-2-post-clamping-mount-6mm-bore/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/311/images/2392/1400-0032-0006-Beauty1__08663__59155.1701991580.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Clamping Mounts / 1-Side, 2-Post Clamping Mounts', 'gobilda'),
  ('1400 Series 1-Side, 2-Post Clamping Mount (8mm Bore)', '1400-0032-0008', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1400-series-1-side-2-post-clamping-mount-8mm-bore/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/312/images/2399/1400-0032-0008-Beauty1__16476__71804.1701991582.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Clamping Mounts / 1-Side, 2-Post Clamping Mounts', 'gobilda'),
  ('1400 Series 1-Side, 2-Post Clamping Mount (12mm Bore)', '1400-0032-0012', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1400-series-1-side-2-post-clamping-mount-12mm-bore/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/314/images/2411/1400-0032-0012-Beauty1__41843__19956.1701991586.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Clamping Mounts / 1-Side, 2-Post Clamping Mounts', 'gobilda'),
  ('1400 Series 1-Side, 2-Post Clamping Mount (14mm Bore)', '1400-0032-0014', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1400-series-1-side-2-post-clamping-mount-14mm-bore/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/316/images/2423/1400-0032-0014-Beauty1__71437__96633.1701991589.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Clamping Mounts / 1-Side, 2-Post Clamping Mounts', 'gobilda'),
  ('1400 Series 1-Side, 2-Post Clamping Mount (15mm Bore)', '1400-0032-0015', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1400-series-1-side-2-post-clamping-mount-15mm-bore/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/318/images/2438/1400-0032-0015-Beauty1__90458__15026.1701991593.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Clamping Mounts / 1-Side, 2-Post Clamping Mounts', 'gobilda'),
  ('1400 Series 1-Side, 2-Post Clamping Mount (21mm Bore)', '1400-0032-0021', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1400-series-1-side-2-post-clamping-mount-21mm-bore/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/320/images/2451/1400-0032-0021-Beauty1__11012__42442.1701991597.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Clamping Mounts / 1-Side, 2-Post Clamping Mounts', 'gobilda'),
  ('1400 Series 1-Side, 2-Post Clamping Mount (22mm Bore)', '1400-0032-0022', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1400-series-1-side-2-post-clamping-mount-22mm-bore/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/313/images/2405/1400-0032-0022-Beauty1__46247__90262.1701991584.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Clamping Mounts / 1-Side, 2-Post Clamping Mounts', 'gobilda'),
  ('1400 Series 1-Side, 2-Post Clamping Mount (25mm Bore)', '1400-0032-0025', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1400-series-1-side-2-post-clamping-mount-25mm-bore/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/315/images/2417/1400-0032-0025-Beauty1__51166__16278.1701991587.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Clamping Mounts / 1-Side, 2-Post Clamping Mounts', 'gobilda'),
  ('1400 Series 1-Side, 2-Post Clamping Mount (32mm Bore)', '1400-0032-0032', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1400-series-1-side-2-post-clamping-mount-32mm-bore/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/317/images/2432/1400-0032-0032-Beauty1__80038__79661.1701991591.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Motors / Motor Mounts', 'gobilda'),
  ('1400 Series 1-Side, 2-Post Clamping Mount (36mm Bore)', '1400-0032-0036', 'Fasten a 36mm diameter gear motor to your robot chassis using this mount. The clamping mount measures 24mm from base to center, providing a plethora of gear ratio options while staying on the 48mm center to center dimension.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1400-series-1-side-2-post-clamping-mount-36mm-bore/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1071/images/5269/1400-0032-0036-REV1__36545__49904.1701992481.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Motors / Motor Mounts / Motor Mounts for REV Robotics Motors', 'gobilda'),
  ('1400 Series 1-Side, 2-Post Clamping Mount (37mm Bore)', '1400-0032-0037', 'Fasten a 37mm diameter gear motor to your robot chassis using this mount. The clamping mount measures 24mm from base to center, providing a plethora of gear ratio options while staying on the 48mm center to center dimension. To adjust the mesh of gears on a motor which has an off-center shaft, simply loosen the pinch bolt and rotate the motor inside the clamp.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1400-series-1-side-2-post-clamping-mount-37mm-bore/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/319/images/2445/1400-0032-0037-Beauty1__48691__55840.1701991595.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Motors / Motor Mounts / Motor Mounts for REV Robotics Motors', 'gobilda'),
  ('1401 Series 2-Side, 2-Post Clamping Mount (43mm Width, 22mm Bore)', '1401-0043-0022', 'The 22mm Bore 2-Side, 2-Post Clamping Mount is perfect for mounting 22mm diameter motors and tubing to your goBILDA® structure! Highly compact thanks to its groundbreaking pinch-bolt location, the mount features goBILDA® thru-holes on the face and sides to allow for a variety of installations—especially inside goBILDA® 1120 Series U‑Channel and 1121 Series Low‑Side U-Channel.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1401-series-2-side-2-post-clamping-mount-43mm-width-22mm-bore/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1731/images/9086/1401-0043-0022-Main-Flipped__33846__75910.1701993675.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Clamping Mounts / 2-Side, 2-Post Clamping Mounts', 'gobilda'),
  ('1401 Series 2-Side, 2-Post Clamping Mount (43mm Width, 32mm Bore)', '1401-0043-0032', 'This 32mm bore clamping mount is perfect for mounting a motor, tube, or pattern spacer solidly in the center of 1120 Series U-Channel. It features four threaded side holes in addition to convenient front-facing thru-holes that expand installation possibilities.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1401-series-2-side-2-post-clamping-mount-43mm-width-32mm-bore/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1108/images/5519/1401-0043-0032-Main-Flipped-Rev1__35896__30282.1701992558.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Motors / Motor Mounts', 'gobilda'),
  ('1401 Series 2-Side, 2-Post Clamping Mount (43mm Width, 36mm Bore)', '1401-0043-0036', 'This 36mm clamping mount is able to fasten inside of 1120 Series U-Channel to hold a 36mm diameter object, such as a 5203 or 5204 Series Planetary Gear Motor in the center of the channel cavity. Clamping, rather than using the threaded holes on the face of the motor, allows you to quickly and easily adjust the position of the motor forward and aft in order to gain proper alignment between drive components. The threaded holes on the sides of the mount allow for a simple and solid attachment…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1401-series-2-side-2-post-clamping-mount-43mm-width-36mm-bore/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1110/images/5528/1401-0043-0036-Rev1__89471__81804.1701992561.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Motors / Motor Mounts', 'gobilda'),
