  ('1502 Series 4mm ID Spacer (6mm OD, 10mm Length) - 4 Pack', '1502-0006-0100', 'This 10mm length spacer works well as a general spacer, but is also an integral part of using W-Wheels. The 10mm length matches the 10mm width of a W-Wheel, so you can fasten the spacer and wheel using an M4 screw without creating an axial load on the bearings within the W-Wheel.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1502-series-4mm-id-spacer-6mm-od-10mm-length-4-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/716/images/16000/1502-0006-0100__13625.1771273249.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Linear Motion Guides / V-Guide Based', 'gobilda'),
