  ('1502 Series 4mm ID Spacer (6mm OD, 12mm Length) - 4 Pack', '1502-0006-0120', 'This 12mm length spacer is the epitome of the classical maker''s Keep-It-Simple philosophy! Is it this spacer''s 4mm ID that''s caught your attention, as you can use it as a spacer on a 4mm shaft? Or is it its 6mm OD, which you can affix a clamp onto or use with a 6mm ID bearing? In any case, when it comes to general utility, spacers of various lengths are nice to have on hand when exploring the depths of your innovation.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1502-series-4mm-id-spacer-6mm-od-12mm-length-4-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/720/images/15988/1502-0006-0120__28813.1771272999.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Standoffs & Spacers / Spacers / 4mm ID x 6mm OD Spacers', 'gobilda'),
