  ('1502 Series 4mm ID Spacer (6mm OD, 48mm Length) - 4 Pack', '1502-0006-0480', 'This 48mm length spacer is the epitome of the classical maker''s Keep-It-Simple philosophy! Is it this spacer''s 4mm ID that''s caught your attention, as you can use it as a spacer on a 4mm shaft? Or is it its 6mm OD, which you can affix a clamp onto or use with a 6mm ID bearing? In any case, when it comes to general utility, spacers of various lengths are nice to have on hand when exploring the depths of your innovation. The 48mm length conveniently keeps you building on-pattern with the 8mm…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1502-series-4mm-id-spacer-6mm-od-48mm-length-4-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2543/images/16910/w%25252F492%25252F1502-0006-0480__57515__31942.1783705471.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Standoffs & Spacers / Spacers / 4mm ID x 6mm OD Spacers', 'gobilda'),
  ('1502 Series 4mm ID Spacer (6mm OD, 50mm Length) - 4 Pack', '1502-0006-0500', 'This 50mm length spacer is the epitome of the classical maker''s Keep-It-Simple philosophy! Is it this spacer''s 4mm ID that''s caught your attention, as you can use it as a spacer on a 4mm shaft? Or is it its 6mm OD, which you can affix a clamp onto or use with a 6mm ID bearing? In any case, when it comes to general utility, spacers of various lengths are nice to have on hand when exploring the depths of your innovation.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1502-series-4mm-id-spacer-6mm-od-50mm-length-4-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2545/images/16916/s%25252F808%25252F1502-0006-0500__01846__78900.1783705479.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Standoffs & Spacers / Spacers / 4mm ID x 6mm OD Spacers', 'gobilda'),
  ('1502 Series 4mm ID Spacer (6mm OD, 56mm Length) - 4 Pack', '1502-0006-0560', 'This 56mm length spacer is the epitome of the classical maker''s Keep-It-Simple philosophy! Is it this spacer''s 4mm ID that''s caught your attention, as you can use it as a spacer on a 4mm shaft? Or is it its 6mm OD, which you can affix a clamp onto or use with a 6mm ID bearing? In any case, when it comes to general utility, spacers of various lengths are nice to have on hand when exploring the depths of your innovation. The 56mm length conveniently keeps you building on-pattern with the 8mm…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1502-series-4mm-id-spacer-6mm-od-56mm-length-4-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2541/images/16905/z%25252F501%25252F1502-0006-0560__80916__43764.1783705466.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Standoffs & Spacers / Spacers / 4mm ID x 6mm OD Spacers', 'gobilda'),
  ('1503 Series M4 x 0.7mm Shoulder Standoff (5-6mm OD, 10-8mm Length) - 4 Pack', '1503-5100-6080', 'These shoulder standoffs allow you to mount 3600 Series V-Wheels, holding the center of the wheels 13mm off the surface the standoffs are fastened to. The 13mm height allow for 1mm of clearance between the mounting surface and the adjacent surface of the goRAIL®.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1503-series-m4-x-0-7mm-shoulder-standoff-5-6mm-od-10-8mm-length-4-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/726/images/4152/1503-5100-6080__14794__14384.1701992113.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Wheels & Tires / V-Wheels', 'gobilda'),
  ('1503 Series M4 x 0.7mm Shoulder Standoff (5-6mm OD, 10-16.5mm Length) - 4 Pack', '1503-5100-6165', 'These shoulder standoffs allow you to mount 3600 Series V-Wheels, holding the center of the wheels 21.5mm off the surface the standoffs are fastened to. Given the 43mm inside width of 1120 Series U-Channel, mounting the standoffs inside the channel puts the wheels equidistant from the two sides. This setup aligns the goRAIL® right down the center of the channel so you can connect it to a drive such as a lead screw.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1503-series-m4-x-0-7mm-shoulder-standoff-5-6mm-od-10-16-5mm-length-4-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/728/images/4157/1503-5100-6165__23557__38293.1701992114.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Wheels & Tires / V-Wheels', 'gobilda'),
  ('1503 Series M4 x 0.7mm Shoulder Standoff (5-6mm OD, 10-19mm Length) - 4 Pack', '1503-5100-6190', 'These shoulder standoffs allow you to mount 3600 Series V-Wheels, holding the center of the wheels 24mm off the surface the standoffs are fastened to. Keeping the center height, and therefore the center of the goRAIL®, on a standard 24mm spacing keeps your project on pattern.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1503-series-m4-x-0-7mm-shoulder-standoff-5-6mm-od-10-19mm-length-4-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/730/images/4162/1503-5100-6190__64078__67960.1701992116.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Wheels & Tires / V-Wheels', 'gobilda'),
  ('1503 Series M4 x 0.7mm Shoulder Standoff (6-8mm OD, 10-8mm Length) - 4 Pack', '1503-6100-8080', 'This standoff provides a low-profile solution for mounting W-Wheels. The center of the W-Wheel will be 13mm from the base of the shoulder standoff, allowing for a mere 1mm of clearance when running the W-Wheels on the goRAIL®. If you''re concerned about the overall height of the assembly, this length is a great option.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1503-series-m4-x-0-7mm-shoulder-standoff-6-8mm-od-10-8mm-length-4-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/732/images/4165/1503-6100-8080__97650__24619.1701992118.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Linear Motion Guides / V-Guide Based', 'gobilda'),
  ('1503 Series M4 x 0.7mm Shoulder Standoff (6-8mm OD, 10-19mm Length) - 4 Pack', '1503-6100-8190', 'This standoff provides an on-pattern solution for mounting W-Wheels. The center of the W-Wheel will be 24mm from the base of the shoulder standoff, allowing the rest of your build to remain on grid.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1503-series-m4-x-0-7mm-shoulder-standoff-6-8mm-od-10-19mm-length-4-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/734/images/4177/1503-6100-8190__84175__21613.1701992121.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Linear Motion Guides / V-Guide Based', 'gobilda'),
