  ('1505 Series 32mm OD Counterbored Pattern Spacer (12mm Length)', '1505-0032-0120', 'This 12mm length, 32mm OD pattern spacer boasts a 14mm bore with shallow counterbores on each side to provide clearance to flanged bearings. You can keep its build surface free of obstruction thanks to 16mm square pattern thru-holes with deep counterbores that allow screw heads to sit underneath the build surface. Threaded holes, meanwhile, provide for attachment on either side. And just like all of our 32mm diameter components, this spacer can be used in 32mm ID bearings and clamps to create…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1505-series-32mm-od-counterbored-pattern-spacer-12mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1814/images/9750/1505-0032-0120_Ang1__20066__62477.1701993890.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Pattern Spacers', 'gobilda'),
  ('1505 Series 32mm OD Counterbored Pattern Spacer (16mm Length)', '1505-0032-0160', 'This 16mm length, 32mm OD pattern spacer has a 14mm bore with shallow counterbores on each side to provide clearance to flanged bearings. You can keep its build surface free of obstruction thanks to deeply counterbored thru-holes on the goBILDA® 16mm pattern that allow screw heads to sit underneath the build surface. Threaded holes on the same pattern provide for attachment on either side. And just like all of our 32mm diameter components, this spacer can be used in 32mm ID bearings and clamps…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1505-series-32mm-od-counterbored-pattern-spacer-16mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1997/images/10929/1505-0032-0160-Ang1__65638__62279.1701994259.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Pattern Spacers', 'gobilda'),
  ('1506 Series 32mm ID Spacer (36mm OD, 4mm Length) - 2 Pack', '1506-0032-0004', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1506-series-32mm-id-spacer-36mm-od-4mm-length-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/328/images/2513/1506-0032-0004__03294__16847.1701991614.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Shaft Spacers & Shims', 'gobilda'),
  ('1506 Series 32mm ID Spacer (36mm OD, 6mm Length) - 2 Pack', '1506-0032-0006', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1506-series-32mm-id-spacer-36mm-od-6mm-length-2-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/330/images/2525/1506-0032-0006__87717__53839.1701991618.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Shaft Spacers & Shims', 'gobilda'),
  ('1511 Series 32mm OD Counterbored Pattern Spacer (6mm Length)', '1511-0032-0060', 'The counterbored thru-holes of this pattern adaptor align with the Tetrix® 16mm hub pattern. Use 6-32 screws to fasten the adaptor to a Tetrix hub—or nearly any Tetrix® part—leaving you with a clean and clear surface to attach a goBILDA® component via its M4 threaded holes. For even more versatility, the thru-holes are sized to accommodate M4 hardware. This allows the adaptor to be used on any 8mm grid, whether that of a Tetrix® or goBILDA® component.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1511-series-32mm-od-counterbored-pattern-spacer-6mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/741/images/4228/1511-0032-0060__29420__30040.1701992135.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('1512 Series 6mm ID Spacer (8mm OD, 4mm Length) - 4 Pack', '1512-0008-0040', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1512-series-6mm-id-spacer-8mm-od-4mm-length-4-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1139/images/5716/1512-0008-0040__87261__66816.1701992622.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('1512 Series 6mm ID Spacer (8mm OD, 6mm Length) - 4 Pack', '1512-0008-0060', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1512-series-6mm-id-spacer-8mm-od-6mm-length-4-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1279/images/6336/1512-0008-0060__59066__45184.1701992820.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('1512 Series 6mm ID Spacer (8mm OD, 8mm Length) - 4 Pack', '1512-0008-0080', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1512-series-6mm-id-spacer-8mm-od-8mm-length-4-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1141/images/5729/1512-0008-0080__13495__92508.1701992626.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('1512 Series 6mm ID Spacer (8mm OD, 12mm Length) - 4 Pack', '1512-0008-0120', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1512-series-6mm-id-spacer-8mm-od-12mm-length-4-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1129/images/5648/1512-0008-0120__07737__33390.1701992599.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('1513 Series Offset Standoff (4mm Length) - 4 Pack', '1513-0001-0004', 'For those times where it would be helpful to have holes offset 4mm from the original locations. Offset standoffs have three mounting holes. Two holes are spaced 8mm apart to align with the grid pattern. The third hole is horizontally centered between the first two, and vertically offset by 4mm. This opens up some build options you would not otherwise be able to tap into. Offset standoffs pair well with V-Wheels and W-Wheels which call for very specific mounting distances when used in…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1513-series-offset-standoff-4mm-length-4-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1159/images/5803/1513-0001-0004__85853__76511.1701992651.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Standoffs & Spacers / Offset Standoffs', 'gobilda'),
  ('1514 Series 8mm ID Spacer (10mm OD, 4mm Length) - 4 Pack', '1514-0010-0040', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/1514-series-8mm-id-spacer-10mm-od-4mm-length-4-pack/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1329/images/6544/1514-0010-0040__15870__91761.1701992885.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
